<BaseLayout
  title="Vacuum Conveyors: Vacuum Belt & Vacuum Tube Systems"
  description="Vacuum conveyors: vacuum belt for flat/thin products (sheets, labels, film) and vacuum tube for bulk powders and granules. Applications, sizing, and system design."
